Priority Change Effort Impact
──────── ────────────────────────────────────────────── ────── ──────
P0 isInterruptible() — GCP spot gets labels+MHC Small High
P0 Generalize remediation controller taint checks Small High
P1 Azure SpotVMOptions API type Medium Medium
P1 InterruptionHandlingReady condition Small Medium
P1 Default maxSurge=2 for interruptible NodePools Small Medium
P2 Interruptible drain timeout cap Small Low
