// +kubebuilder:validation:XValidation:rule="!has(self.management) ||
//   self.management.upgradeType != 'InPlace' ||
//   !(has(self.platform.aws) && has(self.platform.aws.placement) &&
//     self.platform.aws.placement.marketType == 'Spot')",
//   message="InPlace upgrades are not recommended for Spot instances; use Replace instead"
```

Rationale: InPlace upgrades drain and reboot the same machine. If the instance is interrupted mid-upgrade, it's lost permanently, and the MachineSet controller must provision a fresh instance anyway — negating the benefit of InPlace.

